<view class="page"><view class="safe-top"/><view class="detail-top"><button class="back" bindtap="back">‹</button><view class="detail-title">本次同行群聊</view><button class="text-link" bindtap="more">处理</button></view><view class="page-copy">仅已加入的成员可见；行程结束后归档为只读。</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在进入群聊…</view><view wx:else class="chat-list"><block wx:for="{{messages}}" wx:key="_id"><view class="chat-message"><view class="chat-name">{{item.sender_name||'同行者'}}</view><view class="chat-bubble">{{item.body}}</view><view class="chat-time">{{item.created_at}}</view></view></block><view wx:if="{{!messages.length}}" class="empty">还没有消息。<br/>从这次具体的出发开始聊聊吧。</view></view><view wx:if="{{!readOnly}}" class="composer"><input placeholder="在本次群聊里说点什么…" value="{{text}}" bindinput="input"/><button bindtap="send">发送</button></view><view wx:if="{{showReport}}" class="modal-mask" bindtap="closeReport"><view class="bottom-sheet" catchtap=""><view class="sheet-handle"/><view class="sheet-title">反馈这次同行</view><textarea class="field-textarea" placeholder="请说明需要处理的情况" value="{{reportReason}}" bindinput="reportInput"/><button class="primary-btn sheet-btn" loading="{{reporting}}" bindtap="submitReport">提交反馈</button></view></view></view>